OL,3,GNEWSAFast-track cardiology unit cuts
OL,4,Aadmissions, trust says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new fast-track cardiology unit has
OL,7,Fcut inpatient admissions by 25% in its
OL,8,Ffirst three weeks and provided
OL,9,F"extremely encouraging" results, a
OL,10,Fhospital trust has said.
OL,12,FThe same day emergency care unit, which
OL,13,Fopened at East Surrey Hospital in
OL,14,FRedhill in August, aims to improve the
OL,15,Fflow of patients out of A&E to reduce
OL,16,Ftreatment times.
OL,18,FSurrey and Sussex Healthcare NHS Trust
OL,19,Fsaid 80 patients have been assessed,
OL,20,Ftreated and discharged within 24 hours
OL,21,Fsince the unit opened, helping free-up
OL,22,Fbeds for more serious patients.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
