OL,3,GNEWSAFast-track cardiology unit cuts
OL,4,Aadmissions, trust says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Stamp, chief executive at the
OL,7,Ftrust, said the unit "will improve the
OL,8,Fwider experience for those attending
OL,9,Four Emergency Department".
